      "writtenOn": "2025-05-28T01:46:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is necessary because of the `Defer` function above. Otherwise compiles will get:\n\n```\nerror: must use \u0027class\u0027 tag to refer to type \u0027Defer\u0027 in this scope\n\nnote: class \u0027Defer\u0027 is hidden by a non-type declaration of \u0027Defer\u0027 here\n```",
